{[%evp 0,3,29997,29998,29999,-30000]} {[#]} 4. Qh6+ {Thedovetail mateis a
common method of checkmating, and is also known asCozio's mate, named after a
study byCarlo Cozio, published in 1766. It involves trapping the black king in
the patternshown. It does not matter how the queen is supported and it does
not matter which type Black's other two pieces are so long as neither is an
unpinned knight.} Kg3 5. Qh2# *

